  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "实习生拿工资吗  (Do Interns Draw a Salary?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the Xingtian corridor, data-company boss Ji Xiu praises Chun Yuqiao's secret guest strategy, just before upset intern Bu Xiaogu confronts him for treating staff like chess pieces. Listen to what happens.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你是怎么想到请柳凡的？真佩服你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你们的备用方案比我的数据还要准。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "柳凡一直都是我的第一方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我的天哪，你们把我骗得太惨了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么你把员工当棋子？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你让我们的努力白白浪费了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这样也叫努力工作？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你以为你们真的能做这个节目吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看了二十年电视，你就能做电视了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "念了几年书，你就觉得自己专业了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的老师天天夸你吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "实习生拿工资吗？去努力工作！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through each line. The visiting boss starts by applauding the surprise move.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你是怎么想到请柳凡的？真佩服你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did you think of inviting Liu Fan? I really admire you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你们的备用方案比我的数据还要准。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your backup plan was even more accurate than my data.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "柳凡一直都是我的第一方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Liu Fan was my first-choice plan all along.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我的天哪，你们把我骗得太惨了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh my goodness, you fooled me completely!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么你把员工当棋子？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you treat staff members like chess pieces?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你让我们的努力白白浪费了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You made all our hard work go to waste for nothing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这样也叫努力工作？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You call what you did working hard?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你以为你们真的能做这个节目吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you think you can really make this show?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看了二十年电视，你就能做电视了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After watching television for twenty years, can you suddenly make television?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "念了几年书，你就觉得自己专业了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After studying for a few years, do you think you are a professional?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的老师天天夸你吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your teacher praises you every day, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "实习生拿工资吗？去努力工作！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do interns draw a salary? Go work hard!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你是怎么想到请柳凡的？真佩服你！",
      "gap": 0.5
