    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Yuqiao's harsh lecture stings Xiaogu's pride, even before she learns he actually fought to keep her at Xingtian. You learned \"peifu\" for 'admire', \"ni yiwei\" for challenging a wrong assumption, and \"na gongzi\" for drawing a salary. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
